{
  "id": 288109761,
  "iid": 14783,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Let `check_dissector.py` work on plugin dissectors",
  "description": "Allow the tools called by the helper script `tools/check_dissector.py`\nto work on plugin dissectors, as well as those in `epan/dissectors/`.\n\nThe tools `check_dissector_urls.py`, `check_static.py`, `check_tfs.py`,\nand `check_val_to_str.py` all forced a prefix of `epan/dissectors/` on\nfilenames that didn't start with `epan`. When used on plugin dissectors\nthis resulted in invalid paths such as\n`epan/dissectors/plugins/epan/transum/packet-transum.c`.\nChanged each tool to test if the filename being passed in exists first,\nand only adding the prefix if it doesn't.\n\n`check_static.py` silently failed if the object file corresponding to\nthe dissector wasn't in `<build folder>/epan/dissectors/`. Now it tests\nfor the dissector source path starting with `epan` or `plugins` and\nbuilds correct paths to the object file in both cases.\n\nThere may be further changes needed to cause our helper scripts to fully\nfunction on plugins, but this first step handles some of the simplest\nomissions.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-03-12T15:24:34.824Z",
